                            <comment id="16863147" author="dmekhanikov" created="Thu, 13 Jun 2019 14:43:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I prepared a patch for this issue: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4566&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4566&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Invocation to &lt;tt&gt;p2pMarshal&lt;/tt&gt; on continuous query handlers were missing in&#160;a few&#160;places.&#160;Also now peer class loading of remote filters is postponed till the moment when the node joins the topology.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
